<title>SINGAPORE: China's Fujian refinery restarted Saturday - source.</title>
<headline>China's Fujian refinery restarted Saturday - source.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 80,000 barrels-per-day Fujian refinery in China restarted operations on Saturday after more than a month of maintenance, a refinery source said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes, we have restarted on Saturday and it is now running smoothly,&quot; a refinery source said.</p>
<p>During the shutdown, the refinery raised production capacity to four million tonnes (80,000 barrel-per-day) from 2.5 million tonnes (51,000 bpd).</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
